<map version="1.0.1"><node TEXT="Inventaria-Thesaurus"><node TEXT="activities" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000001</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000001</p><p>Definition: Dieser Term beinhaltet Typen intentioneller Aktionen, die in der Erhaltung, Herstellung, Modifikation oder Zerstörung einer Entität (Lebewesen; konzeptionelle/materielle Objekte; Gruppen; soziale, intellektuelle, physische Phänomene usw.) resultieren.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="actions" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000026"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000026</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000026</p><p>Definition: In den Inventaren genannte Handlungen an Objekten oder Räumen (besichtigen, finden, versiegeln, kaufen …).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="answer" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0002"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0002</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0002</p><p>Spellings (1): geanburt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="board up" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0018</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0018</p><p>Spellings (1): verslagen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="buy" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0009"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0009</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0009</p><p>Spellings (1): zekawffen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="cost" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0010"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0010</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0010</p><p>Spellings (1): gestet</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="cut open" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0003</p><p>Spellings (2): auff gesnitten, auffgeschriben</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="find" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0006</p><p>Spellings (3): hat man funden, funden, gefunden</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="give" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0007"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0007</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0007</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="hanging" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0008</p><p>Spellings (1): hangenden</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inspect" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0004</p><p>Spellings (2): beschawt worden, beschawt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="lay" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0011</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0011</p><p>Spellings (1): gelegt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="look at" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0001</p><p>Spellings (1): angesehen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="order" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0014</p><p>Spellings (1): geschaffen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="seal" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0019</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0019</p><p>Spellings (1): ver bettschafft</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="strike" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0015"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0015</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0015</p><p>Spellings (1): slagt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="view" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0005"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0005</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0005</p><p>Spellings (1): besicht</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="wall up" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0013</p><p>Spellings (1): zumawren</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="water" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0020"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_action:0020</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_action:0020</p><p>Spellings (1): zu wassern</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="functions" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000013</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000013</p><p>Definition: This term classifies activities that are structural parts of a relatively stable complex system of permanent and self-contained procedures that repeat themselves within this system and thus contribute to its preservation. Although functions are part of a wider system, each function is completely distinct from the rest. As structural parts of a complex system, functions are actions that play a certain role within a system and aim at a specific goal, which they must accomplish. In this respect it is not possible that the purpose which a certain function has to achieve is different from that for which the function is performed. In other words, the purpose of a function is one of its identity criteria. Consequently, the notion of the function univocally relates the actions performed and the target achieved by these actions in such a way that, if some other target is achieved due to external factors, we speak of a different function or activity.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;governance&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="event_type" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000044"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000044</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000044</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="creation of associated letter" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000046"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000046</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000046</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="creation of inventory" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000045"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000045</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000045</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="extension of inventoy" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000048"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000048</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000048</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventoring a room" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000049"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000049</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000049</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventorying an object" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000051"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000051</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000051</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventorying an object category" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000050"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000050</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000050</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Loan" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000052"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000052</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000052</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="sending" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000053"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000053</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000053</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="human interactions" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000011</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000011</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne les activités menées par au moins un acteur causant ou changeant un phénomène ou une situation au niveau social, politique, financier, culturel ou intellectuel.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;social events, confrontations or conflicts&quot;, &quot;political&quot;, &quot;social and economic occurrences&quot;, &quot;group management&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="context_of_origin" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000006</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="change of administrator" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000040"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000040</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000040</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="change of manager" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000041"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000041</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000041</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="change of ownership" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000033"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000033</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000033</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="equipment" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000034"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000034</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000034</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inheritance" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000035"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000035</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000035</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventory of growth" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000038"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000038</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000038</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventory of shortages" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000037"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000037</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000037</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="inventorying after siege" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000036"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000036</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000036</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="object transfer" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000039"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000039</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000039</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node></node><node TEXT="conceptual objects" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000006</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000006</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne les objets dont l’essence reste la même quel qu’en soit le support. Ce sont des produits de l’activité humaine qui s’appuient sur l’utilisation de procédés techniques ou électroniques (photo numérique, mesures géométriques) or non (concepts, pensée). Le fait qu’ils soient matériels ne détermine pas leur identité. Les objets conceptuels ont la capacité à exister sur plus d’un seul support en même temps (photos, mémoire humaine, papier, signaux électroniques) sans que cela change leur identité. Au contraire toute modification de l’objet conceptuel (révision, recadrage) change la définition de son identité.
Les objets conceptuels existent tant qu’on peut les trouver sur au moins un support (y compris la mémoire humaine). Leur existence se termine quand le dernier support et la dernière mémoire sont perdus.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="communication systems (language)" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000064"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 0000064</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000064</p><p>Definition: Ο όρος αναφέρεται στους διαύλους μεταφοράς νοημάτων και μηνυμάτων από έναν πομπό σε έναν παραλήπτη, μέσω της χρήσης αμοιβαίως κατανοητών σημείων, σημάτων, εικόνων και σημειωτικών κανόνων. Ως πομπός και παραλήπτης νοούνται τα άτομα ή οι ομάδες που συμμετέχουν στην πράξη της επικοινωνίας. Τα βασικά στάδια της επικοινωνίας, τα οποία χαρακτηρίζουν εγγενώς κάθε σύστημα επικοινωνίας, είναι τα ακόλουθα: (a) η ύπαρξη επικοινωνιακού σκοπού/στόχου, (b) η σύνθεση του μηνύματος, (c) η κωδικοποίηση του μηνύματος, (d) η μετάδοση του μηνύματος ως ακολουθία σημείων/σημάτων διά μέσου ενός συγκεκριμένου διαύλου επικοινωνίας, (e) η λήψη των σημάτων και η εκ νέου σύστασή/συγκρότησή τους σε μήνυμα εκ μέρους του αποδέκτη, (f) η αποκωδικοποίηση του εκ νέου συστημένου/συγκροτημένου μηνύματος και (g) η κατανόηση κι η ερμηνεία του του θεωρούμενου ως αρχικού μηνύματος</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="language" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000007"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000007</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000007</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Early new High German" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000042"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000042</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000042</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Latin" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000043"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000043</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000043</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="concepts" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000024"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000024</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000024</p><p>Definition: This term classifies concepts for use in categorizing and/ or systematizing aspects of our perceptible reality. These concept types express fundamental ways of viewing reality and are drawn from different conceptual contexts, each expressing a particular standpoint. They arise from the discussion and comparison of the formulation, definition and use of concepts in different disciplines. They are thus, among other things, meant to play a kind of mediating role between various disciplines and are proposed towards the end of establishing a common inter-disciplinary and inter-thematic conceptual framework.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;identity&quot;,&quot;social identity&quot;,&quot;gender identity&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="properties and conditions" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000018"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000018</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000018</p><p>Definition: Qualitative Angaben zu Objekten in den Inventaren (Alter, Zustand, Form, Füllstand, Bewertung, Beschaffenheit).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="age and state of preservation" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000019</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000019</p><p>Definition: Angaben zu Alter, Vollständigkeit, Beschädigung und Gebrauchsspuren eines Objekts.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="alive" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0044"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0044</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0044</p><p>Spellings (1): lebentig</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="almost ruined by rust" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0014</p><p>Spellings (1): dŭrch den rosst vast verdorben</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="badly broken" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0070"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0070</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0070</p><p>Spellings (2): gar zenichten, garzenichte</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="badly torn" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0073"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0073</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0073</p><p>Spellings (1): vast zerrissen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="broken" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0038"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0038</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0038</p><p>Spellings (1): zenicht</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="broken (shattered)" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0089"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_quality:0089</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_quality:0089</p><p>Spellings (12): brochen, zebrochen, zer¬ prochen, zerprochens, zebrochne, Czerbrochen, zerprochenn, zerprochns, zerbrochner, prochenn, zueprochen, zerprochen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="broken off" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_q