g:00031"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_processing:00031</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00031</p><p>Spellings (1): ungedroschne</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="without metal mounts" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00030"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_processing:00030</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00030</p><p>Spellings (1): unpeslagen</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="written on parchment" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_processing:00004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_processing:00004</p><p>Spellings (1): aȗf pergamen geschrieben</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="propositional objects" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000022"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000022</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000022</p><p>Definition: Este conceito classifica conteúdos mentais produzidos pela atividade humana, representando dados de realidades físicas, lógicas, psicológicas ou mesmo fictícias. Estes objetos, embora expressos pelo uso de símbolos, não dependem deles, facto que permite a sua transcrição para outro conjunto de símbolos. No entanto, um objeto proposicional às vezes não pode ser diferenciado dos símbolos utilizados (por exemplo, um poema).

Exemplos de conceitos subordinados: “objetos de informação”, “partes estruturais de objetos de informação”.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;information objects&quot;,&quot;structural parts of information objects&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="type_inventory" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000001</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="Document type: secondary extension" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000054"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000054</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000054</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventory type: estate register" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000011</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000011</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventory type: part inventory" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000010"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000010</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000010</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventory type: person related" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000008</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Inventory type: room related" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000009"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000009</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000009</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="symbolic objects" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000021"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000021</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000021</p><p>Definition: This term classifies identifiable symbols and/or any aggregation of symbols, that have an objectively recognizable structure and that are documented as single units (sets or arrays of signs). Symbolic objects may serve to designate something, or to communicate some propositional content, but they don’t depend on what they designate or communicate. They can exist on one or more carriers simultaneously without this feature adding to or removing from the identity of the symbols. Being objectively recognizable and documented as single units, symbolic objects are independent of the material carrier and the symbolized content as well. Consequently symbolic objects may or may not have a specific meaning.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;information objects &quot;,&quot;structural parts of information objects&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="certification" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000005"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000005</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000005</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="chirograph" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000031"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000031</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000031</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="seal" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000030"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000030</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000030</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="signature" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000032"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000032</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000032</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="internal_order_entries" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000004</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="columns" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000028"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000028</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000028</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="graphic signs" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000027"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000027</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000027</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="headings" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000026"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000026</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000026</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="highlighting" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000024"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000024</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000024</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="layout/structure" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000029"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_terminus:000029</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000029</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="lines" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_terminus:000025"><richcontent TYPE