516</p><p>Definition: Dach aus geschnittenen, mit --&gt;Scharnägeln befestigten (Schar-)Schindeln</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 1 Einträge in 1 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="thing" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000017"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:000017</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000017</p><p>Spellings (2): dïng, dingen</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 8 Einträge in 8 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node><node TEXT="physical features" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000019"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000019</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000019</p><p>Definition: Ce terme désigne des formations spécifiques intégralement adaptées à certains objets matériels. Elles ne peuvent donc être séparées de l’objet qui les porte mais ne s’identifient pas à cet objet puisque seule une partie de l'objet les supporte. En ce sens, la caractéristique est fixe par rapport à cet objet de sorte que toute tentative de la retirer résulterait dans la perte d’une partie de l’objet qui la porte. Elles peuvent avoir une forme bi ou tri dimensionnelle mais il n’existe pas de limite qui les sépare complètement,  de façon objective, de l’objet. Certaines caractéristiques physiques être des caractéristique au sens le plus restreint  (entailles, trous, reliefs, surface colorée) alors qu'au sens large elles sont des parties d'objets aux limites non définies comme le centre de la terre ou la tête d'une statue de marbre.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;reliefs &quot;, &quot;granules&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="colours" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000017"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv:000017</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv:000017</p><p>Definition: Farbangaben zu Objekten und Textilien in den Inventaren, einschließlich heraldischer Farben (z. B. „Görzer Farben“).</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="black" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0012"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0012</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0012</p><p>Spellings (21): swarz, schwarzn, swarcze, swartz, swarczem, schwarcz, swarcz, swartzn, swarczen, sbarczer, sbarczen, swarczn, swartze, schwartzn, schwartzen, schwȃtzen, sbarcz, swartzen, swarczer, swartzer, schwartz</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="blue" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0001"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0001</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0001</p><p>Spellings (13): plabs, blaben, blab, plaws, plaber, plab, plabn, blaber, plaben, plabenn, plabe, plaw̑, plaban</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="brown" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0002"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0002</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0002</p><p>Spellings (14): praȗn, prawn, brawns, praŭn, prawnn, praw̆n, prawns, praẘn, praw̆nenn, braw̆ns, praw̆nem, praw̆ne, praun, praȗne</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Duke Sigismund's colour" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0008"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0008</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0008</p><p>Spellings (1): hertzog Sigmunds farb</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="Gorizia colours" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0004"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0004</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0004</p><p>Spellings (1): Gŏrtz varb</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="green" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0006"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0006</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0006</p><p>Spellings (23): grun, grien, grȗene, grůn, grũens, grůen, grŭnem, gruen, gruens, grȗens, grŭenn, grůenem, grũene, grún, grŭenem, grũen, grŭen, grüen, grŭenß, grŭn, grȗen, grȏne, gru̇n</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="grey" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0005"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0005</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0005</p><p>Spellings (6): grabn, grab, graben, graws, grabem, graw̆</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="light blue" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0007"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0007</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0007</p><p>Spellings (1): liechtplabs</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="liver-coloured" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0009"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0009</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0009</p><p>Spellings (8): leberv̊arbn, lebervarben, leberv̊arben, lebervarbm, lebervarb, leber varben, lebervarbn, lebervarbe</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="multicoloured" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0014"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0014</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0014</p><p>Spellings (2): allerlaẏ varb, allerlai ander varb</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="red" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0010"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0010</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0010</p><p>Spellings (19): rŏter, rott, rotten, rotm, rŏttn, rotem, rottem, rotts, rotter, roter, ro̊ttem, roten, rottn, rote, rŏtem, röt, ratcs, rotte, rots</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="scarlet" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0011"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0011</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0011</p><p>Spellings (1): scharlatt</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="silver" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0013</p><p>Spellings (1): silber varbn</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="white" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0015"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0015</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0015</p><p>Spellings (22): wyss, weissen, weysse, weýss, weys, weysser, weisse, weis, weisser, weisn, weissn, wey̆s, weÿssen, weissem, weyssen, weỹssen, weÿsse, weysses, weÿss, weyss, weissr, weiss</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="yellow" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_color:0003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_color:0003</p><p>Spellings (6): gel, gels, gelbem, gell, gelber, gelbe</p></body></html></richcontent></node></node></node><node TEXT="structural parts of material objects" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000020"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 000020</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/000020</p><p>Definition: Este conceito classifica objetos especialmente construídos para serem partes de um objeto físico complexo. Estes objetos têm autonomia em relação ao objeto complexo ao qual se destinam a serem adicionados. Apesar da sua autonomia, eles não são independentes em relação à função pretendida, mas são partes estruturais do objeto, ou seja, têm uma função específica dentro do módulo ao qual pertencem e ao qual dão forma. Nota: Os conceitos das partes estruturais não são considerados como conceitos subordinados da agregação a que pertencem.

Exemplos de conceitos subordinados: “cordas”, “bases (componentes de objetos)”.</p><p>Narrower term examples: &quot;strings&quot;, &quot;bases (object components)&quot;</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="building part" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000133"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000133</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000133</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="altar" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000077"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:000077</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000077</p><p>Broader concepts: building part | religious spaces | sacred objects | religious buildings</p><p>Spellings (1): alter tisch</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 3 Einträge in 3 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="balcony (Altan)  ↗" COLOR="#808080" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000165"><font ITALIC="true" NAME="SansSerif" SIZE="12"/><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>Polyhierarchy – narrower concepts under: material things › built environment › rooms and spaces</p><p>ID: inv_r:000165</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000165</p><p>Broader concepts: rooms and spaces | building part</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="bastion or tower" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000167"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_r:000167</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000167</p><p>Broader concepts: building part | building</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="beam" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000812"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:000812</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000812</p><p>Spellings (1): träm</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 1 Einträge in 1 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="church gallery  ↗" COLOR="#808080" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000168"><font ITALIC="true" NAME="SansSerif" SIZE="12"/><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>Polyhierarchy – narrower concepts under: material things › built environment › building › religious buildings</p><p>ID: inv_r:000168</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000168</p><p>Broader concepts: religious buildings | building part | religious spaces</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="column" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001713"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001713</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001713</p><p>Spellings (1): seȗln</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 2 Einträge in 1 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="door" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000375"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:000375</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:000375</p><p>Spellings (4): thŭr, thũr, thȗr, thúr</p><p>In den Inventaren belegt: 5 Einträge in 5 Inventaren.</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="door  ↗" COLOR="#808080" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000195"><font ITALIC="true" NAME="SansSerif" SIZE="12"/><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>Polyhierarchy – narrower concepts under: material things › built environment › rooms and spaces › passage</p><p>ID: inv_r:000195</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_r:000195</p><p>Broader concepts: passage | building part</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="door hinge strap" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001183"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_o:001183</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_o:001183</p><p>Definition: bandförmiges, mit einem Scharnier versehe