kills and professions, social agency and status, economic position, cultural identity, religious or philosophical convictions and mindsets, states of health or psychological disposition.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="roles of individuals" FOLDED="true" LINK="https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000074"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: 0000074</p><p>URI: https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000074</p><p>Definition: This hierarchy comprises the types of attitudes and/or social behaviors that are expected of a person and which result from or are acquired through the relation of that person with other individuals or social groups.</p></body></html></richcontent><node TEXT="addressee" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000025"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_role:000025</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000025</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="administrator" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000012"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_role:000012</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000012</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="administrator assistant" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000013"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_role:000013</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000013</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="attendee" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000003"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_role:000003</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000003</p></body></html></richcontent></node><node TEXT="borrower" LINK="https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000024"><richcontent TYPE="NOTE"><html><head/><body><p>ID: inv_role:000024</p><p>URI: https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/E55_type/inv_role:000024</p></body></h